Package: idiographic
Type: Package
Title: Person-Specific Statistics and Heterogeneous Dynamic Networks
Version: 0.4.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    utils::person("Mohammed", "Saqr", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        email = "saqr@saqr.me"),
    utils::person("Sonsoles", "López-Pernas", role = "aut",
        email = "sonsoles.lopez@uef.fi"))
Author: Mohammed Saqr [aut, cre, cph],
    Sonsoles López-Pernas [aut]
Maintainer: Mohammed Saqr <saqr@saqr.me>
Description: Person-specific and within-person statistical modelling for
    intensive longitudinal and panel data. Provides descriptive statistics,
    linear and generalized linear models, machine learning, within-between
    decomposition, coefficient pooling and shrinkage, subgroup discovery,
    treatment effects, heterogeneity analysis, and honest temporal validation.
    Dynamic-network estimators include ordinary and graphical vector
    autoregression, multilevel and Bayesian vector autoregression, unified
    Structural Equation Modeling, and Group Iterative Multiple Model
    Estimation. Core estimators use native clean-room implementations and are
    validated against authoritative literature. Methods are described in
    <doi:10.1007/978-3-031-95365-1_20> and
    <doi:10.1080/00273171.2018.1454823>.
